  "description": "A .NET library for converting Office Math Markup Language (OMML/OMath) to MathML. Uses XSLT transformation with the proven stylesheet from plurimath/omml2mathml Ruby implementation. Supports fractions, superscripts, subscripts, radicals, matrices and more. Perfect for processing Word documents with mathematical formulas.",
